<title>USA: Tracor buys military products business.</title>
<headline>Tracor buys military products business.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tracor Inc's aerospace unit said Tuesday it bought the Military Products Group of Dayton Ohio-based Calspan SRL Corp, which makes monitors, radar scan converters, symbol generators, and night vision goggle-compatible beacons.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed, but the group had 1996 sales of about $16 million, Tracor said.</p>
<p>The Military Group makes the products for the U.S. Air Force special forces and other customers, Tracor said.</p>
</text>
